DOCKER HUB IMAGE UPLOAD GUIDE
============================

PURPOSE
-------
Upload a local Docker image to Docker Hub and use it from Kubernetes.

IMAGE DETAILS
-------------
Local Image:

sre-copilot:latest

Example Docker Hub Repository:

hyareldocker1/sre-copilot:latest


STEP 1 - VERIFY DOCKER IMAGE
----------------------------

# list docker images
docker images

Expected:

REPOSITORY      TAG
sre-copilot     latest


STEP 2 - LOGIN TO DOCKER HUB
----------------------------

# login to docker hub
docker login

OR

# login with username
docker login -u hyareldocker1

Recommendation:
Use a Docker Hub Personal Access Token (PAT)
instead of your password.


STEP 3 - CREATE DOCKER HUB REPOSITORY
-------------------------------------

Login:
https://hub.docker.com

Create Repository:

sre-copilot

Repository Name Example:

hyareldocker1/sre-copilot


STEP 4 - TAG LOCAL IMAGE
------------------------

# tag local image for Docker Hub
docker tag sre-copilot:latest hyareldocker1/sre-copilot:latest

Verify:

docker images

Expected:

sre-copilot                    latest
hyareldocker1/sre-copilot      latest


STEP 5 - PUSH IMAGE
-------------------

# upload image to Docker Hub
docker push hyareldocker1/sre-copilot:latest

Note:
Large images may take several minutes to upload.


STEP 6 - VERIFY IMAGE
---------------------

Open:

https://hub.docker.com/r/hyareldocker1/sre-copilot

Verify:

latest tag exists.


STEP 7 - KUBERNETES DEPLOYMENT
------------------------------

Update deployment.yaml

Old:

image: sre-copilot:latest

New:

image: hyareldocker1/sre-copilot:latest

Apply Deployment:

kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml

Restart Deployment:

kubectl rollout restart deployment sre-copilot


STEP 8 - VERIFY PODS
--------------------

kubectl get pods

Expected:

STATUS
Running


TROUBLESHOOTING
---------------

Problem:
ErrImagePull

Cause:
Image not available in Docker Hub.

Fix:
Verify image exists in repository.


Problem:
ImagePullBackOff

Cause:
Incorrect image name or tag.

Fix:
Check deployment.yaml image value.


USEFUL COMMANDS
---------------

# list local images
docker images

# login
docker login

# tag image
docker tag sre-copilot:latest hyareldocker1/sre-copilot:latest

# upload image
docker push hyareldocker1/sre-copilot:latest

# verify deployment
kubectl get deployments

# verify pods
kubectl get pods

# pod details
kubectl describe pod POD_NAME

